<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why Line differential protection?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>The SIPROTEC 7SD80 is a line differential protection relay. It provides selective line protection for power cables and overhead lines up to 24 km, supporting all types of starpoint configurations. Ensuring fast and stable line protection in industrial and distribution grids is crucial. Our SIPROTEC 7SD80 features an implemented phase comparison algorithm for reliable and efficient safeguarding of your lines. The phase comparison algorithm delivers rapid and stable protection, minimizing downtime and enhancing grid reliability. Communicate directly without external equipment using copper wires, optical fibers or both in redundancy for flexible protection for your infrastructure.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='6RnybZoutcfA1hssV2Pz9h' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='6RnybZoutcfA1hssV2Pz9h'>
